        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-06-21T18:21:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"mwc146\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n mwc146:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I could've sworn he said she's in a crysalis state \"in Akash'Flora,\" like Akash'Flora is an environment that houses her.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Ah, you're right, and even more so: \"in&nbsp;<em>the</em> Akash'Flora in downtown Megalopolis.\" &nbsp;So it seems to be some sort of creation separate from her. &nbsp;Can't tell from this whether it's a whole environment (I'm thinking like a whole Central Park-type area created by her blooms) or just the chrysalis itself (I'm imagining a big bud that serves as a local landmark or monument).</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
