        "created_at": "2017-06-22T14:37:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>No one has mentioned this, but Christopher dropped a knowledge bomb that caught me off gaurd.</p><p>Quando? Ahora!</p><p>The character pictured that the forums has generally accepted to be some kind of cross between Tachyon and Omnitron is <em>actually</em> Unity</p><p>Ok, it's not a major knowledge bomb. I lied. But I figured I'd point this out just incase it slipped past some folks.</p>",
